        "type": "TA",
        "text": "Default Transition"
      },
      {
        "nodeID": 21,
        "type": "L",
        "text": "Fredrich Engels: When I submitted arguments like these to the most rabid anti-authoritarians, the only answer they were able to give me was the following"
