        "text": "Default Transition"
      },
      {
        "nodeID": 26,
        "type": "L",
        "text": "Anti-Authoritarian: Yes, that’s true"
      },
      {
        "nodeID": 27,
        "type": "YA",
        "text": "Agreeing"
      },
      {
        "nodeID": 62,
        "type": "TA",
        "text": "Default Transition"
      },
      {
        "nodeID": 90,
        "type": "CA",
        "text": "Default Conflict"
      },
      {
        "nodeID": 31,
        "type": "L",
        "text": "Anti-Authoritarian: but there it is not the case of authority which we confer on our delegates, but of a commission entrusted"
      },
